  "description": "CR 603.2 / 608.2c / 111.1: Replicating Ring adds a night counter each of its controller's upkeeps, then at eight or more removes them all and creates eight colorless snow artifact Replicated Rings that tap for any color",
  "note": "Alice's ring at seven reaches eight and replicates; her ring at six reaches seven and does not, so the threshold is eight, not seven; on her turn 4 that ring reaches eight and replicates, while the emptied ring restarts at one. Bob's ring gains a counter on his upkeep only, not on alice's. A Replicated Ring taps for red snow mana, and the ring at seven for green.",
